---
---

<section id="flagship" class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-white">
  <div class="section-padding max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="reveal max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <span class="inline-block text-sunset-500 text-sm font-sans font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Flagship Project</span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-900 leading-tight text-balance">
        Fortune Green City
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-neutral-500 font-sans leading-relaxed text-pretty max-w-2xl">
        Not just a plot of land, but a lifestyle decision and a valuable investment for your family's future. Phase-I is currently underway.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">

      <!-- Card 1: The Vision (spans 2 cols) -->
      <div id="vision" class="reveal lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden min-h-[340px] group">
        <img
          src="/images/green-park.jpg"
          alt="Beautifully landscaped community park with walking paths"
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/40 to-black/10"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-end h-full p-8 sm:p-10">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 w-fit px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-leaf-500/20 backdrop-blur-sm border border-leaf-400/30 text-leaf-300 text-xs font-sans font-semibold tracking-wide mb-4">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.036 12.322a1.012 1.012 0 010-.639C3.423 7.51 7.36 4.5 12 4.5c4.638 0 8.573 3.007 9.963 7.178.07.207.07.431 0 .639C20.577 16.49 16.64 19.5 12 19.5c-4.638 0-8.573-3.007-9.963-7.178z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
            THE VISION
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white leading-snug text-balance max-w-lg">
            Weekend holiday homes where your family creates lasting memories.
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-white/70 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-md text-pretty">
            Imagine waking up to birdsong, surrounded by lush greenery, just a short drive from the city. Fortune Green City is designed for families who want the best of both worlds.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Prime Location -->
      <div class="reveal rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[340px] group hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors duration-300">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-sunset-500/15 text-sunset-400 mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25S4.5 17.642 4.5 10.5a7.5 7.5 0 1115 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Prime Location</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty">
            Strategically positioned in Hyderabad's rapidly developing green corridor. Excellent connectivity to the city with the serenity of nature at your doorstep.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-6 text-sunset-400 font-sans text-sm font-semibold group-hover:gap-3 transition-all">
          <span>View on Map</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 19.5l15-15m0 0H8.25m11.25 0v11.25" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Resort-Style Amenities -->
      <div class="reveal rounded-2xl bg-leaf-600 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[280px] group hover:bg-leaf-700 transition-colors duration-300">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-white/15 text-white mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.429 9.75L2.25 12l4.179 2.25m0-4.5l5.571 3 5.571-3m-11.142 0L2.25 7.5 12 2.25l9.75 5.25-4.179 2.25m0 0L12 12.75 6.429 9.75m11.142 0l4.179 2.25L12 17.25 2.25 12l4.179-2.25" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Resort-Style Amenities</h3>
          <p class="text-white/75 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty">
            Planned parks, landscaped gardens, walking trails, children's play areas, and 24/7 gated security. Every weekend feels like a resort getaway.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/15 text-white text-xs font-sans font-medium">Parks</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/15 text-white text-xs font-sans font-medium">Security</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/15 text-white text-xs font-sans font-medium">Gardens</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/15 text-white text-xs font-sans font-medium">Play Areas</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Smart Investment (spans 2 cols) -->
      <div class="reveal lg:col-span-2 rounded-2xl bg-stone-100 border border-stone-200/60 p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-sunset-50 text-sunset-500 mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18L9 11.25l4.306 4.307a11.95 11.95 0 015.814-5.519l2.74-1.22m0 0l-5.94-2.28m5.94 2.28l-2.28 5.941" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">A Smart Investment</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 font-sans leading-relaxed text-pretty">
            Land in Hyderabad's green corridors has seen consistent appreciation over the past decade. Fortune Green City is positioned in one of the fastest-growing sectors, making it not just a lifestyle choice but a financially sound decision for your family.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:w-56">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-stone-200">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-leaf-500"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 font-sans">RERA Approved</p>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 font-sans">Verified & Compliant</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-stone-200">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-leaf-500"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 font-sans">Title Status</p>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 font-sans">100% Clear</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-stone-200">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sunset-500"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 font-sans">Phase Status</p>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 font-sans">Phase-I Active</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
